      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ريّغ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He smeared, seasoned, imbued,</i> or
<i>soaked,</i> a mess of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيد</span> [i. e. broken, or crumbled,
bread, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالدَّسَمِ</span>] <i>with grease,</i> or <i>gravy,</i> or <i>dripping;
i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوَّغَهَا</span> (En-Nadr, K, TA) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالدَّسَمِ</span> (En-Nadr,
TA.)

